<li><strong>Rotas:</strong> <code>app/</code> — Expo Router (file-based).</li>
<li><strong>Componentes:</strong> <code>components/</code> — cards do dashboard, painéis de manutenção, formulários, mapa, UI compartilhada.</li>
<li><strong>Contexto:</strong> <code>context/EntityPrefixContext.tsx</code> — prefixo de entidade para IDs.</li>
<li><strong>Constantes visuais:</strong> <code>constants/theme.ts</code>.</li>
